2:Tfff,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"BlogPosting","@id":"https://www.melius.com/blog/product-hero-shot#article","headline":"How to generate a product hero shot on Melius","description":"Generate a product hero shot from a pack shot on Melius, and keep the product dimensionally and visually accurate instead of nearly right.","url":"https://www.melius.com/blog/product-hero-shot","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.melius.com/blog/product-hero-shot"},"datePublished":"2026-09-14","dateModified":"2026-09-14","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Melius Team","url":"https://www.melius.com"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://www.melius.com/#organization"},"isPartOf":{"@id":"https://www.melius.com/#website"},"inLanguage":"en-US","image":"https://www.melius.com/images/blog/product-hero-shot/cover.webp","timeRequired":"PT7M","wordCount":1354,"articleSection":"Guides","keywords":"Guides"},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Blog","item":"https://www.melius.com/blog"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"How to generate a product hero shot on Melius","item":"https://www.melius.com/blog/product-hero-shot"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use AI for product photography?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, for hero shots, lifestyle scenes, background variants and channel-specific crops, generated from a pack shot you already have. What it does not do on its own is guarantee the product is accurate, which is why the workflow feeds in the product's real specifications and branding as separate inputs and ends with a check against the actual item."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is a product hero shot?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The main image a shopper sees first, on a listing, an ad or a landing page. It has to read at a glance and it has to look like the thing that arrives, which is why it's the shot where product fidelity matters most."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why does my logo come out wrong in AI product photos?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Because the model draws your logo from scratch on every generation. It rebuilds an approximation of everything in frame, and a logo is exactly the kind of arbitrary artwork that can't be inferred from context. Adding the logo file as its own reference node, and instructing the prompt not to redraw it, is the fix."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I still need a photographer?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For the input, often yes. This workflow starts from a clean pack shot, and the quality of that photograph sets the ceiling on everything generated from it. What changes is the volume: one good pack shot can carry a season of scenes, ratios and variants that would each have been a separate setup."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I keep a product consistent across many shots?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Build the canvas once on a single SKU until the output is right, then duplicate it and swap the inputs. Reusing the graph is what keeps the lighting and the framing from drifting between shots, and it's how high-volume teams produce variants at catalogue scale."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What resolution should I generate product shots at?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"2K or higher. Generating at 2K isn't the same as upscaling a 1K image afterwards: the model has more room to resolve fabric weave, embossed marks and label typography while it works, and upscaling later operates on an image whose fine detail is already gone. Note that the canvas preview is downscaled at any resolution, so judge sharpness from the full-screen view or the download."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does generating product photos cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Generation runs on credits from one shared pool, whichever model a step uses, so trying the same shot on two models costs nothing extra in setup. Current plans and credit allowances are on the pricing page."}}]}]}7:X
